#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:260
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:325
